 * `{discountLabel && (...)}` conditional in index.tsx emits NO `zimm-discount-label` node for
 * every pre-existing story that doesn't pass the prop (Default, MultipleItems, GiftCard) —
 * importing those stories' REAL `args`/`render` straight from index.stories.tsx, not a
